port Administration Charge).","source":{"title":"Airport Administration Charge (Amendment) Act, 2026 (No. 8 of 2026)","url":"https://laws.gov.ag/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/No.-8-of-2026-The-Airport-Administration-Charge-Amendment-Act-2026.pdf","retrievedAt":"2026-11-26","effectiveFrom":"2026-09-01","effectiveTo":null},"fact":{"id":"ag.travel.departure.international-arriving-antigua.2026-09-01","taxType":"travel.departure","jurisdiction":"ag","level":"national"}},{"label":"Airport administration charge: transiting passenger","value":30,"unit":"money","currency":"USD","note":"each transiting passenger into Antigua (Airport Administration Charge).","source":{"title":"Airport Administration Charge (Amendment) Act, 2026 (No. 8 of 2026)","url":"https://laws.gov.ag/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/No.-8-of-2026-The-Airport-Administration-Charge-Amendment-Act-2026.pdf","retrievedAt":"2026-11-26","effectiveFrom":"2026-09-01","effectiveTo":null},"fact":{"id":"ag.travel.departure.transit.2026-09-01","taxType":"travel.departure","jurisdiction":"ag","level":"national"}},{"label":"Airport administration charge: domestic passenger (each arrival or departure)","value":4,"unit":"money","currency":"USD","note":"each arriving and each departing domestic passenger (Airport Administration Charge).","source":{"title":"Airport Administration Charge (Amendment) Act, 2024 (No. 19 of 2024)","url":"https://laws.gov.ag/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/No.-19-of-2024-The-Airport-Aministration-Charge-Amendment-Act-2024.pdf","retrievedAt":"2026-11-26","effectiveFrom":"2024-10-01","effectiveTo":null},"fact":{"id":"ag.travel.departure.domestic.2024-10-01","taxType":"travel.departure","jurisdiction":"ag","level":"national"}},{"label":"Airport administration charge: international passenger arriving in or departing Barbuda","value":100,"unit":"money","currency":"USD","note":"each international passenger arriving into or departing out of Barbuda (Airport Administration Charge).","source":{"title":"Revenue (Miscell